{"description":"Can you believe it’s been 10 years since Insecure first aired? A true classic that somehow never gets old. And since the anniversary tour wasn’t making its way to Toronto, we decided to host our own in collaboration w/ Joelle .\nWhether you’re insecure about wine and want to explore it without all the pretension, or you simply want to enjoy Insecure over wine, this one’s for you.\nWe’ll sip through three wines, revisit three moments from the show, and get into the hot takes, questionable decisions, and conversations that Insecure always seems to bring out.\n\nWhat’s Included:\n‘We Got Ya’ll’  Welcome Drink: A refreshing non-alcoholic drink to kick off the evening.\n3 Pour Flight: A curated 3-wine tasting inspired by Insecure with each wine paired to a character or story arc from the show. 3 oz pours.Non-alcoholic wine option available, courtesy of Acquired Taste\nInsecure Screening: Three moments from the show, followed by curated hot takes and conversation.\nSounds from @chiefteef: Because what would Insecure be without the soundtrack?\n\nBites & More\nWe’ve linked up with The Annex Hotel to curate a small bites menu that will be available for purchase throughout the evening.\nIn the meantime, let's keep in touch 🫶\nInstagram: @letslinkup.to\nWebsite: letslinkup.ca\n***\nTickets are non-refundable but can be transferred to a friend if you're unable to attend.\n📸 By attending, you consent to being photographed and/or videographed for event content. Prefer to stay off-camera? Let us know!","organizer":"Link Up"}